                        "email": "potin.lai@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "potinlai"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi @rickyaz@meta.com, \n\nWe would like to assign each SMA EID and its downstream device EIDs within a dedicated range, so we configured EID_POOL_SIZE=9.\n\nExample allocation:\nmcu1u2u1u1: HPM0 SMA (10), POOL (11-19)\nmcu1u2u2u1: HPM1 SMA (20), POOL (21-29)\n......"
